Z||000000||Homicidal||06-01-2000||12:50 AM||||Seeing your baby all shiny and glimmery with shimmering tires and windows and clean bright headlights after a nice wash and wax.  Brings tears to my eyes!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I don't think I can stop looking at it! *runs out to window*.  HEHE.<P>Really though, I have one of the best looking Fiero's in the area.  I take care of it and make sure she's washed all the time.  Looks better then those ricers everywhere.  And down here in San Diego we get the Cholo cars also.<P>They take EVERY car imaginable and LOWER it.  I've seen vans to Nissan Sentras (new ones) to friggin PINTOS lowered with rims and extended axels so the wheels pop out.  Truly absurd.<P>I get looks on my car not only cause it looks great, but because it's not 1/2" from the ground with a spoiler that spans two lanes and exhaust tips looking like cannons. <P>Anybody with me?||||reg||6
