Z||000008||Homicidal||06-01-2000||04:18 PM||||Stimpy, you misunderstand and you are most likely hypocritical too, since I know you have made fun of a ricer or two in your life.<P>And when I say "exhaust tips like I cannons", I MEAN cannons.  I have seen some really oversized and stupid exhaust tips.  The ones you guys are talking about are fine.  And the spoiler I was talking about I have seen twice so far.  It stands probably as high as our Fieros and damn near as long as them too.  I doubt you guys have anything near these.<P>Stimpy, I am allowed to poke fun wherever I please, since I'm sure people look at us and say "Look at those idiots in those little plastic death-traps."<P> <P>||||reg||1
